# Ignored for the 1.6 release on 2026-10-08. Each entry is unreachable in this service as
# deployed; the dependency bumps follow under the dependency-update process.
#
# self_hosted_hub's agent-facing endpoints sit behind the ingress auth service. pgx and
# amqp091-go talk to the in-cluster Postgres and RabbitMQ only; x/crypto handles keys we
# generate ourselves.

# github.com/jackc/pgx/v5 v5.5.4 — 2 (CRITICAL), fixed in 5.9.0. Not reachable: the server is our own in-cluster Postgres.
